{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19219","headline":"寄唐州杨八归厚 · 刘禹锡","name":"寄唐州杨八归厚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淮安古地拥州师，画角金铙旦夕吹。\n浅草遥迎鷫鸘马，春风乱颭辟邪旗。\n谪仙年月今应满，戆谏声名衆所知。\n何况迁乔旧同伴，一双先入凤凰池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}